  << /ActualText (For a pure\054 cold\054 silvery metallic shine with no yellowish undertones\054 silver and palladium are viable options\056 But there is a catch\056 These shades lack a protective polymer coating\054 leaving the ultra\055thin metallic layer exposed to constant friction from the wrist and clothing\056 They are also made with genuine precious metals\054 driving the price up significantly\056 A piece made with these is definitely not meant for everyday wear\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
